# FamilyRoots — Universal Messages Route & Real-Time Chat Across All Dashboards

## 1. Overview
A unified **Messages** route has been integrated across all dashboard experiences within the FamilyRoots platform:
1. **Owner Dashboard**: `/owner-dashboard?tab=messages` (and `/owner-dashboard/messages`)
2. **User / Member Dashboard**: `/user-dashboard?tab=messages` (and `/user-dashboard/messages`)
3. **Admin Dashboard**: `/admin-dashboard/messages`
4. **Viewer Dashboard**: `/owner-dashboard?tab=messages`

---

## 2. Architecture & Components

### A. Navigation Integration
- **`SanctuaryDashboardWrapper.tsx`**:
  - `normalizeDashboardTab`: maps `"messages"`, `"message"`, `"chat"`, `"inbox"` $\to$ `"messages"`.
  - Added `{ name: "Messages", href: "/owner-dashboard?tab=messages", tabKey: "messages", icon: MessageSquare, badge: "3" }` for owners.
  - Added `{ name: "Messages", href: "/user-dashboard?tab=messages", tabKey: "messages", icon: MessageSquare, badge: "2" }` for members.
- **`AdminLayout.tsx`**:
  - Added `{ name: "Messages", href: "/admin-dashboard/messages", icon: MessageSquare }`.
- **`ViewerDashboardPage.tsx`**:
  - Added `{ name: "Messages", href: "/owner-dashboard?tab=messages", icon: MessageSquare }`.

### B. The `MessagesTab` Component (`src/components/dashboard/tabs/MessagesTab.tsx`)
A state-of-the-art interactive family communication center featuring:
- **Left Panel (Contacts & Channels)**:
  - Header with search filter.
  - Category filter pills: `All Chats`, `Channels`, `Direct`.
  - Family Sanctuary Circle: Broadcast group channel for announcements and reunions.
  - Direct contacts list populated dynamically from sanctuary member records with avatar, role badge, last message snippet, timestamp, unread counter, and online status indicator.
- **Right Panel (Live Chat Stream & Input)**:
  - Top header displaying conversation title, participant/channel count, status indicator, voice call and video gathering action buttons.
  - Chat bubbles:
    - Incoming messages: distinct slate styling, avatar, sender name, message timestamp.
    - Outgoing messages: purple/indigo gradient, double checkmark read receipts, optimistic send animation.
  - Reaction support (`❤️`, `🙏`, `🎉`, `👍`).
  - Input bar with attachment button, emoji button, and real-time send button with auto-scroll to bottom.

---

## 3. URL Route Matrix

| Dashboard | Query Tab Route | Direct Page Route | Role Permissions |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Sanctuary Owner** | `/owner-dashboard?tab=messages` | `/owner-dashboard/messages` | Full administrative broadcast & direct messaging |
| **Family Member** | `/user-dashboard?tab=messages` | `/user-dashboard/messages` | Family circle chat & direct relative messaging |
| **System Admin** | N/A | `/admin-dashboard/messages` | Platform communications & monitoring |
| **Viewer** | `/owner-dashboard?tab=messages` | `/owner-dashboard/messages` | Read & participate in family conversations |

---

